      "mobile_label": "Phones (under 750px), through the header bar",
      "note": "Three regimes, two tokens: the row (>= 1200px) wears --t-wordmark-size; phones (<= 749px) get --t-wordmark-size-m through html.js .site-header { --bar-logo } (T2.1); the 750-1199px bar size calc(1.125rem * var(--heading-scale, 1) * 1.05) stays bound to its literal. No :root switch.",
